================================================================================
Bundled Windows tools (Windows package only, in bin/)
================================================================================

- FFmpeg / FFprobe — LGPL-2.1-or-later build from
  https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds (win64-lgpl). Unmodified binaries,
  source: https://ffmpeg.org/download.html
- Poppler (pdftoppm and DLLs) — GPL-2.0-or-later, build from
  https://github.com/oschwartz10612/poppler-windows. Invoked as a separate
  process, not linked. Source: https://poppler.freedesktop.org/
- AtomicParsley — GPL-2.0, https://github.com/wez/atomicparsley. Invoked as
  a separate process, not linked.
- sqlite-vec (vec0.dll) — MIT or Apache-2.0, https://github.com/asg017/sqlite-vec.
  Loaded as a SQLite extension for the vector search.

These programs keep their own licenses. PageMentor calls them as external
processes; only sqlite-vec is loaded into the process as a SQLite extension.
